{
  "slug": "kopi-email-marketing",
  "name": "Kopi Email Marketing",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Brand-aware lifecycle email marketing for Klaviyo. Draft, analyze, and diagnose emails from a one-line prompt.\n\nAudit email marketing performance, find ideas for what to send next, generate on-brand images, and build multi-step flows, all in the voice and style your brand has already defined.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `audit-brand` (Kopi (brand-aware Klaviyo email): run a full lifecycle audit of one brand's email program — program health, campaigns,…), `surface-email-ideas` (Kopi (brand-aware Klaviyo email): find and rank email campaign ideas for a brand — core campaigns, flow updates,…)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `kopi-email-marketing`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install kopi-email-marketing@claude-community` from `tryrendition/kopi-email-marketing-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 2,
    "hook": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
